Common Midterm Deliverables
 Requirement:

Common midterm deliverables are (a lot of which were already completed in previous milestones):

A front-end container that interacts with the user via HTTP and communicates with the messaging container.
Registration Page, Login Page, Landing Page
A messaging container (RabbitMQ) that brokers the exchange of information between the front-end, the back-end and the database.
Queue / Exchange are setup and accepting data flow
A database container (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, MySQL) that the back-end uses for the storage of data. All relevant information should be stored in a VirtualBox / VMWare / Docker volume.
Database should have table(s) on persistent volume that can be accessed by required systems
A back-end container that gathers information from your data sources, populates the database, and interacts with the messaging container.
Should be able to "read from" / "write to" from the database, front-end via RabbitMQ
These four systems will be working with each other to provide a registration and authentication system for your users.
 

